        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r3_in7">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r3_out0">
          <text>false</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>Cal. BPC § 480(a)(2): “and that is substantially related to the qualifications, functions, or duties of the business or profession for which the present application is made”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_discipline_ground_r4">
        <description>'However': the discipline rests on a dismissed conviction (Cal. BPC § 480(a)(2))</description>
        <extensionElements>
          <lex:grounding>
            <lex:source citation="Cal. BPC § 480(a)(2)" section="480" subsection="a.2" code="Cal. BPC" jurisdiction="ca" grounding="explicit" url="https://leginfo.legislature.ca.gov/faces/codes_displaySection.xhtml?lawCode=BPC&amp;sectionNum=480.">
              <lex:quote>However, prior disciplinary action by a licensing board within the preceding seven years shall not be the basis for denial of a license if the basis for that disciplinary action was a conviction that has been dismissed pursuant to Section 1203.4, 1203.4a, 1203.41, 1203.42, or 1203.425 of the Penal Code or a comparable dismissal or expungement.</lex:quote>
            </lex:source>
          </lex:grounding>
        </extensionElements>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in0">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in1">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in2">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in3">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in4">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in5">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in6">
          <text>true</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_in7">
          <text>-</text>
        </inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_discipline_ground_r4_out0">
          <text>false</text>
        </outputEntry>
        <annotationEntry>
          <text>Cal. BPC § 480(a)(2): “However, prior disciplinary action by a licensing board within the preceding seven years shall not be the basis for denial of a license if the basis for that disciplinary action was a conviction that has been dismissed pursuant to Section 1203.4, 1203.4a, 1203.41, 1203.42, or 1203.425 of the Penal Code or a comparable dismissal or expungement.”</text>
        </annotationEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_discipline_ground_r5">
        <description>Discipline within seven years (Cal. BPC § 480(a)(2))</description>
        <extensionElements>
